Student struggles 

What the Game is About:
Student struggling is a short text-based branching game where you are a college student trying survive and balance academics, social life, and stress. Every decision affects your GPA, study hours, social points, and stress level. Good luck.  

The theme is about GPA survival: survive to the end or fail.

Branching Concepts Demonstrated: 
branching logic  
Course Load Choices (`easy`, `mid`, `cry`)
Branching if/elif/else logic that changes `study_hours` and `stress_level` depending on GPA.
Study Subject Selection 
Different outcomes based on whether the player studies Programming, Math, English, or History.  
Compound Conditions
(user_choice == "Programming" or user_choice == "Math") and current_gpa < 3.0`  
 user_choice == "History" or (social_points < 40 or stress_level > 50)`  
Identity Operators (`is` / `is not`)

